<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ENGLAND BY 264 RUNS TO RETAIN ASHES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ENGLAND BY 264 RUNS TO RETAIN ASHES.</headline>
<text>
<p>England second innings</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Healy b McGrath	8</p>
<p> A.Stewart c S.Waugh b Reiffel    16</p>
<p> J.Crawley c Healy b Gillespie    33</p>
<p> N.Hussain b Gillespie		21</p>
<p> G.Thorpe not out		     82</p>
<p> A.Hollioake lbw b Gillespie	 2</p>
<p> B.Hollioake lbw b Warne	     2</p>
<p> R.Croft c McGrath b Warne	   6</p>
<p> A.Caddick lbw b Warne		 0</p>
<p> D.Headley c Healy b McGrath	 4</p>
<p> D.Malcolm c M.Waugh b McGrath     0</p>
<p> Extras (b-6 lb-2 nb-4)	     12</p>
<p> Total				   186</p>
<p>Fall: 1-25 2-25 3-78 4-99 5-121 6-144 7-150 8-166 9-186.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 13.5-4-36-3, Reiffel 11-3-34-1, Gillespie</p>
<p>8-0-65-3, Warne 16-4-43-3.</p>
<p>Result: Australia won by 264 runs to take a 3-1 lead in the</p>
<p>six-test series.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Australia first innings 427 (M.Taylor 76)</p>
<p>England first innings 313 (A.Stewart 87)</p>
<p>Australia second innings 336.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Final test - The Oval, August 21-25</p>
